  "description": "Target inventory follows the configured PVE and guest node_exporter scrape jobs. The guest keep-list excludes swap, ZFS ARC and node_vmstat OOM metrics, so those panels show PVE-host coverage only. The configured datasource does not provide kernel/HA event logs or GPU and power metric fields."
